          "_name": "list03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list03\" group=\"List\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"9\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Ben</b></h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-left item features-without-image mt-0 mb-5 active\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Hakkımda Kısaca</b></h5>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Ben 2008 yılının Mart ayının 16'sında, Sultanbeyli Saygı Hastanesi'nde doğdum. Doğduğumdan beri İstanbul'dayız, Uzundere de bir binada 5 yaşıma kadar oturduk. Sonrasında o bina dere yatağı üzerinde olduğundan dolayı yıkıldı. Yıkıldıktan sonra Uzundere de ki aile binamıza taşındık. Bu zamana kadarda hep orada oturduk.<br><br>Bu süre içinde ben ortaokula yeni geçmişken ailemin yönlendirmesiyle Turgutreis' teki yatılı kuran kursuna yazıldım, 5, 6 ve 7. sınıflarımı kuran kursunda geçirdim, oradan kısaca bahsetmem gerekirse cumartesi öğlen 12 de kurs biter ve pazar akşam ezanında tekrar devam ederdi. Orada olduğum süre boyunca kurs bizlerin gideceği okulları ve servisleri ayarlar bizlere de sadece servis ücretlerini vermek düşerdi. 7. sınıf sonrasında ise kursu LGS için bıraktım.<br><br>LGS den sonra tercihlerimin ilk sırasına SGMTAL' i yazdım, orada benden 1 yaş büyük kuzenim okuyordu ve uçak bakım bölümü cazip gelmişti, evde cihazları sök tak falan yaptığım için, sınav sonuçlandığındaysa orası çıktı. Lise 9, 10, 11. Sınıflarım L şubesinde aynı sınıfla beraber geçti ancak 12. Sınıfta K şubesine geçtim.<br><br>12. Sınıfı okumaya şu anda da devam ediyorum, ilerleyen zamanlarda neler olacağını birlikte göreceğiz...</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-left item features-without-image mt-0 mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Okuduğum Okullar</b></h5>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>İlkokul</b>:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Ahmet Yesevi İlköğretim Okulu<br><b>Ortaokul</b>:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Hasan Ali Yücel Ortaokulu , Şehit İhsan Yıldız Ortaokulu , Battalgazi İHO<br><b>Lise</b>:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sabiha Gökçen Mesleki ve Teknik Anadolu Lisesi</p>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"row justify-content-left item features-without-image mt-0 mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Aldığım Belgeler</b></h5>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">* <b>2016-2017 1. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Takdirname Belgesi<br>* <b>2016-2017 2. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Takdirname Belgesi<br>* <b>2017-2018 1. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 5<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Takdirname Belgesi<br>* <b>2017-2018 2. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Takdirname Belgesi<br>* <b>2018-2019 1. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Teşekkür Belgesi<br>* <b>2020-2021 1. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;8<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Takdirname Belgesi<br>* <b>2020-2021 2. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 8<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Takdirname Belgesi<br>* <b>2022-2023 1. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 10<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Onur Belgesi<br>* <b>2023-2024 1. Dönem</b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 11<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Onur Belgesi<br></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "v5W1XflW6Q",
          "_anchor": "list03-28",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "border-radius": "0 !important",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-iconfont": {
              "font-size": "3rem",
              "color": "@iconColor",
              "padding-right": "2rem"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#385493"
            }
          },
          "_name": "social02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"social02\" group=\"Social\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' &amp;&amp; bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showmainTitle\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showmainSubtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Cards</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcon\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#2e481a\" selected=\"\" condition=\"showIcon\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected=\"\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax=\"\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected=\"\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showmainTitle || showmainSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showmainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Takip Edin</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showmainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFollow us\n\t\t\t\t\t</h6>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/esatde_senbana\" target=\"_blank\"><span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont m-auto socicon-instagram socicon\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 44, 104); fill: rgb(12, 44, 104);\"></span></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Instagram</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Resmi İnstagram Hesabım</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://x.com/AhmetEsatYldrm3\" target=\"_blank\"><span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont m-auto socicon-twitter socicon\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 44, 104); fill: rgb(12, 44, 104);\"></span></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Twitter</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Resmi Twitter Hesabım</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://isgokcen.meb.k12.tr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont m-auto mobi-mbri-globe-2 mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 44, 104); fill: rgb(12, 44, 104);\"></span></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Web</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Okulun Resmi Web Sayfası</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
